                                "sense_id": "51f41796-7a4f-381e-acc2-c3aead267c08",
                                "text": "Gokul (or Goloka)—the innermost realm of love, is, like, Krishna’s Form all-pervading. At Krishna’s will Goloka revolves through all the worlds. From this it follows that Goloka is the realm of his eternal love-games, which successively manifests itself throughout the worlds."
